Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourteenth Episode\NThe Love Letters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finished! Finally it's finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My camera is finished!\NMy beautiful camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to strike a pose! I'll\Nslip on a suitable outfit and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hurry! The\Nself-timer is on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it going off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garigori! I heard\Nthat you invented...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...a strange mechanism that\Nquickly makes small portraits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Would this be it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the one, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is in here?! Hey, what are\Nyou doing standing up there like a statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is this crackling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Prince Sapphire! I see that\Ntoday you are studying hard. Well done! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Sapphire, I had a lot of fun\Nthe other day, with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,at the carnival party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was one of the most beautiful things\NI have ever witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, on that same day,\NI met a beautiful girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,who has remained in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remember, she was the girl\NI danced with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I would immensely like\Nto be able to meet her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I beg you to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...and arrange a meeting with her\Non my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Best regards.\NPrince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid! The girl he\Nmet was actually me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Your Highness!\NAn hour has already passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You have studied enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to reward you\Nfor your diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- What has he prepared for me?\N- If you stand still for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take a nice picture of you\Nwith my brand-new camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Prince,\Ndon't make me waste time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, wait! Don't go!\N- So, have you decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I could take it with this\Nheadpiece and with this girl's dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no!\N- I know I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, a photo\Nof you dressed up like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...would make it obvious\Nthat you are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This photo could even fall into\Nthe hands of Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy would\Nthat be for our kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would you want\Nto do with this photo, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you! It's\Nnone of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how difficult it is for you\Nto pretend to be a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...while you are, in reality,\Na beautiful young girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I want to please you!\NI will take one for you just how you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Poor little thing...!\N- Thank you, Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a serious look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think Prince Franz will still\Nlike this photo anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"To Prince Franz,\Nin the kingdom of Terradoro".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go mail\Nthis letter for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn, I can't reach it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, little horse!\NYou were really kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know\Nthe contents of the letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Sapphire had Opal mail!\NYou see to it, 0017!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Baron Nylon.\NIt will be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all,\NI will use disguise number 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Voilà!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A spy's first task\Nis to steal other people's mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everyone in this village\Na graphomaniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is going to a Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Second task:\Nif nothing was found,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,return the mail,\Nso as not to arouse suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,End of the disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good secret agent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You say there wasn't\Nany letter from Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked all the letters\None by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no suspicious letter\Naddressed to Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, maybe, this was it!\NDid you check it well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- I hope you opened it.\N- Yes! And inside I found...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,..a photograph\Nof a beautiful girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! That was exactly the one\NI was looking for! Go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command!\NI'm going to redo the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When I have that photo..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Your Highness,\Nwhat did you do with that photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to lose it,\Nplease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These are unsafe times
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They ambushed a mail coach\Nand robbed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- You're scaring me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where did they attack him?\N- I heard it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...at the North pasture.\N- Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're looking for my letter!\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn wind!\NIt's driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't imagine it would\Nbe so exhausting being a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I got it! No! This\None is slipping away, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's coming?\N- Here's who took the letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop that sack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My sack!\NSorry, but it's still mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He took it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Third task: climb trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned meddler! I'll\Nmake you fall from this tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth task: never fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth task:\Nescape the enemy by any means!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye-bye! See ya!\N- He's getting away, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!\N- I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent appointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fine, you asked for it!\N- No! Not the anti-aircraft, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My father used to tell\Nme not to aim too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, little goat! Give\Nme back that letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- A goat?!\N- Come here, be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Goats like paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah! She'll eat the letter!\N- Come, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you damned eater\Nof mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth task of a spy: in\Ncase of emergency, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me,\NI'm in a bit of a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The road forks here.\NWhere did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How come I don't see her anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she end up\Nthat damned goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up, my children!\NI am your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mommy!\NCome on in, mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, mom!\N- Hi, mom! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- We missed you!\N- Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you didn't let\Nanyone in while I was away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, mom! No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There are very bad men\Naround, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, mom!\N- This is your dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get in through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means\NI'll have to imitate Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up! Santa Claus is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Santa Claus is coming!\NHe'll come down the chimney!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bad man! Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was passing by this way\Nand I said to myself:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Why not pay a little visit\Nto this lovely little family?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange,\Nhe leaves wolf tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet only that goat\Npassed by here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is too solid!\NClever, these goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found the weak spot.\NNow I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wide enough to see\Ninside. Here are the letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They look delicious! I'm going\Nto eat them right away! Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't eat that\Nletter! Please, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If mom sees you, she'll scold you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do now? I have\Nto give her something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have paper, I only\Nhave money! I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, little goat! This is\Nmuch better than the letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Taste it, come on! Eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes 10,000 Scudi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Will you give me some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Those weren't enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't give them\Nto me, I'll eat this letter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Please, no! Enough!\NI'll give you more! Here, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- More, please!\N- Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I don't have any more!\NI'm ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, children! Since that man\Nhas gone, we can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! I was so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Open, damn wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized that you are actually a wolf\Nand you disguised yourself as a goat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognized your footprints!\NYou won't manage to trick me! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He climbed onto the roof!\NHe wants to get in through the chimney!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could they have hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat our dinner! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mama!\N- Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Let me go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the little goats find out\Nwho I really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- He's coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you live with the little goats,\Nyou who are a she-wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will tell you why.\NMy husband is the master of the woods
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Some time ago he devoured\Nthe mother of those little goats,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then he ordered me\Nto stay with his children
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So I disguised myself as a goat\Nand now I live with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand: you act like a goat\Nso as not to raise suspicion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! My husband wants\Nme to fatten up the kids well for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...before eating them.\NYou know, I've raised them until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...as if I were their mother\Nand they believe I'm the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They love me. No one, before,\Nhad loved me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,.and I treat them like my own children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind you tell me the truth,\Notherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me,\NI've grown fond of them too
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I love them\Nas if they were wolf pups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So much so that when my husband\Ncomes to ask for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defend their little lives\Neven at the cost of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole story has moved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But a spy\Nshouldn't get emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take advantage of the situation\Nand go get the letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- It's my husband coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He is coming here because the time has come for him\Nto devour the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She-wolf, can I kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If this can save the kids,\Nyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you fattened the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.\NI fattened them just as you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they are big enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so much like a goat that I\Nfeel like eating you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With an injured tongue,\NI can no longer eat the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That bad guy\Nwill eat our mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a sword he won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If he runs into me..!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been traveling for a long time,\Nlooking for a beautiful landscape...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...to immortalize in a\Nbeautiful photograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I see! It's a great subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This photo will be a masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince is in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This tree will stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me: Garigori!\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming to help you!\NCharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use my photographic weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit him! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- I did it! Thanks, Garigori!\N- The enemy has been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thanks to you! - I'm happy\Nthat you are safe, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, secret agent 0017\Nhasn't been sitting idle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I got all the letters!\NHere is the one I was looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run and take it to the Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running away with our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you dirty thief!\NIt's our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back our dinner!\NGive us back our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! The letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our dinner!\NOur dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back our meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dinner! Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get out of your way immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.66,0:22:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, little goats,\NI am just as you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am a she-wolf.\N- Mama, I don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are always my mama.\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.74,0:22:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, mama! Come eat\Ndinner with us! Come! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still believe I am your mother\Ndespite my terrible appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, mama! You are still\Nour mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet you are, my children
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, little ones,\Neat peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me: do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.50,0:23:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will take a keepsake photo!\NGather together in a group, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see, Garigori?\NEven a she-wolf...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...can take the appearance\Nof a goat and save the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I too will continue to pretend\Nto be a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...to save my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you!\N- Bye! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye!\N- Goodbye!
